@startuml
!include r4-diagram-style.puml
title FE-11 Review Management
left to right direction
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
class ReviewController <<controller>>
class ReviewEligibilityController <<controller>>
class ReviewModerationController <<controller>>
class ReviewService <<service>>
class Review <<entity>>
class ReviewRevision <<entity>>
class ReviewReply <<entity>>
class ReviewModerationEvent <<entity>>
class ReviewRepository <<repository>>
class ReviewRevisionRepository <<repository>>
class ReviewReplyRepository <<repository>>
class ReviewModerationEventRepository <<repository>>
interface WorkshopAttendanceReviewPort <<port>>
interface RetailFulfilmentReviewPort <<port>>
ReviewController --> ReviewService
ReviewEligibilityController --> ReviewService
ReviewModerationController --> ReviewService
ReviewService --> ReviewRepository
ReviewService --> ReviewRevisionRepository
ReviewService --> ReviewReplyRepository
ReviewService --> ReviewModerationEventRepository
ReviewService --> WorkshopAttendanceReviewPort
ReviewService --> RetailFulfilmentReviewPort
Review "1" o-- "0..*" ReviewRevision
Review "1" o-- "0..1" ReviewReply
Review "1" o-- "0..*" ReviewModerationEvent
note right of ReviewService
Guest public read only.
Member creates/edits own review.
Staff hide; Manager remove/reply.
end note
@enduml
